# Copy this file's variable into your Netlify site's Environment Variables
# (Site settings → Environment variables). NEVER commit a real key to git or
# paste it into any file that gets deployed to the public site.

# Stripe secret key — starts with sk_test_... in test mode, sk_live_... in
# live mode. Get it from https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
